  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The kami like you, and tend to bend over backwards to ensure you stay safe.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Extra Petition, spirit pool class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The size of your spirit pool increases by +3.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain Ally of the Kami multiple times, but cannot gain Ally of the Kami more times than you have gained Extra Petition. Its effects stack.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/onmyodo-feats#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
